kevin: I'll push the snippets shortly. if CI passes and no blocking comments I'll merge by EOD. :rocket:

engdocs: tagging for minor release note sync — will add to the 2026-03-23 changelog entry.

maria: thanks all! will post quick customer-facing blurb after merge. :raised_hands:
